#   `citrus family`, which is Rutaceae and therefore above the genus, so a
#   query cannot ascend to it without also collecting Zanthoxylum. The species
#   link is the route FoodOn itself uses.
obo:FOODON_03411751 rdfs:subClassOf [
    a owl:Restriction ;
    owl:onProperty obo:RO_0002162 ;
    owl:someValuesFrom obo:NCBITaxon_85681 ] .
