    rdfs:comment "`rye bread food product` carries no derives-from at all, so a gluten query reached every rye bread VARIANT (raisin rye, whole grain rye, rye bread (enriched)) and not the product class itself. The label-convention repair pass could not see it because the convention it follows is `<X> food product -> <X> plant` and the source here is named `rye`, not `rye bread`." ;
