### soy sauce food product  --mayDeriveFrom-->  wheat plant
#   evidence:   the wheat share varies by producer and style and is not a property of the sauce; the pack states it, the ontology cannot
#   confidence: high
#   claim:      may_contain
#   query:      wheat plant
#   reviewer:   Matt
#   Soy sauce is brewed from soybeans AND wheat in roughly equal parts in the
#   dominant Japanese and Chinese styles, yet FoodOn asserts no wheat
#   derivation, so the class sits outside the gluten closure entirely. The
#   identity is a soy product; the wheat is a producer choice, which is what
#   may_contain is for. This class also covers `soy sauce (proteolytic
#   fermentation)` and `soy sauce (acid-hydrolyzed)`.
obo:FOODON_00001235 local:mayDeriveFrom obo:FOODON_03411312 .
